# metadata.ts is generated by scripts/generate-blog-metadata.mjs, which writes
# LF, and blogMetadata.test.ts compares the checked-out file to that output byte
# for byte. Under core.autocrlf=true (the Windows machine) checkout hands the
# test CRLF, so it failed there permanently while CI on Linux passed — a red that
# trained everyone to ignore the suite locally.
#
# Pinning the checkout is the fix, not touching the file: the stored blob is
# already LF, and converting the committed content instead is what would break
# CI on Linux.
src/data/blog/metadata.ts text eol=lf
